text:
This is one of those products I want to love, but I'm just not sure about. Similar to others with sensitive skin, I sometimes feel a burning sensation after using it (especially multiple days in a row). It's hard to know whether it's from some of the ingredients designed to brighten, or from the fragrance. (Anyone sensitive to fragrance in any way should NOT buy this product.) I'm also disappointed that a product with "Parfum (Fragrance)" in the ingredient list is allowed to have the Clean at Sephora label. I will not be purchasing this product again, but I could see it working for some people with less sensitive skin or who like more heavily fragranced products. 

@Fresh: Please consider a fragrance-free version of this cream.
@Sephora: Please consider a higher standard for your Clean at Sephora label.

I received this Boum-Boum Milk 🥛 (3 in 1 spray) in exchange for my review. This innovative 3-in-1 toner, serum, and moisturizer, in a unique liquid cream spray, delivers the ease of a minimalist skincare routine with maximum results. The probiotic-based formula is dermatologist tested, non-comedogenic and made with 99% naturally derived ingredients, suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin. With just a few spritzes, it instantly hydrates, smooths, and softens skin for a more radiant complexion. With extended use, it soothes, reduces inflammation and redness, improves firmness, and diminishes wrinkle length and depth, restoring skin to its optimal healthy state.

Vegan, fragrance-free, cruelty-free, and free of silicones.
