I absolutely love this deodorant! The scent feels so luxurious fresh, floral, and peaceful clean while pairing beautifully with most perfumes. 🌸💕 It glides on smoothly and the smell lasted the whole day. I also love that it’s aluminum- free, making it feel like a safe and reliable everyday choice. The packaging is simple and elegant. The price is a bit high but I believe it’s worth it because of the high quality and how gentle this deodorant is in the skin. 

Thank you so much to @influenster and @theouai for this opportunity ✨💖

@influenster @theOUAI #complimentary #theOUAI #OUAI #OUAIDeodorant

